{"video":"aeQu6qWa_LM","lines":[{"t":[0,3.5],"en":"Oh, did you come to Reason with me?"},{"t":[4.5,5.5],"en":"Got you something."},{"t":[10.5,13.5],"en":"And, uh, I just really want to talk to you."},{"t":[13.5,14.5],"en":"Get lost."},{"t":[14.5,16.5],"en":"Well, now, hold on."},{"t":[16.5,18.5],"en":"What are you doing?"},{"t":[18.5,20.5],"en":"What does it look like I'm doing?"},{"t":[20.5,22.5],"en":"Digging a grave for a horse."},{"t":[22.5,23.5],"en":"Um..."},{"t":[25.5,27.5],"en":"Do you need a hand?"},{"t":[27.5,29.5],"en":"Yeah, you need a hand?"},{"t":[29.5,30.5],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[36.5,39],"en":"If you hit another horse, you've dug too far."},{"t":[39,41],"en":"Are you okay, Kevin?"},{"t":[45,46],"en":"Where are you going?"},{"t":[46,47],"en":"In."},{"t":[47,48],"en":"I'm hungry."},{"t":[48,49],"en":"Uh, could we come in, too?"},{"t":[49,50],"en":"Just for some water?"},{"t":[51,52],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[52,53],"en":"Take off your shoes."},{"t":[53,54],"en":"Except you, Kevin."},{"t":[54,55],"en":"They stay on."},{"t":[57,58],"en":"Oh, wow."},{"t":[58,59.5],"en":"I forgot how pretty your house is."},{"t":[59.5,63.5],"en":"This is the newest addition, built by Erasmus Schrute in 1808."},{"t":[63.5,67.5],"en":"It doubled as a tuberculosis recovery room until 2009."},{"t":[67.5,73],"en":"Oh, Pam, you got something on your shirt."},{"t":[73,74],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[74,74.1],"en":"Oh, well."},{"t":[74.1,75],"en":"Po-buddy's nerfect."},{"t":[75,76],"en":"Right?"},{"t":[76,77],"en":"Did you just have a stroke, Pam?"},{"t":[77,78],"en":"It's nobody's perfect."},{"t":[78,79.5],"en":"Nice stroke, Pam."},{"t":[79.5,81.5],"en":"No, it's a jokey saying."},{"t":[81.5,82.5],"en":"Po-buddy's nerfect."},{"t":[82.5,86.5],"en":"Like, I can't even say those words right."},{"t":[86.5,87.5],"en":"I haven't heard that before."},{"t":[87.5,89],"en":"That's funny."},{"t":[89,90],"en":"Dwight, there's just a small matter of..."},{"t":[90,92],"en":"You know what would go so great with this cabbage pie?"},{"t":[92,93],"en":"Milk."},{"t":[93,94],"en":"Any specific animal?"},{"t":[94,94.5],"en":"I'm thinking cow."},{"t":[94.5,95.5],"en":"Don't say cow."},{"t":[95.5,95.6],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[95.6,96.5],"en":"What are you doing?"},{"t":[96.5,97.5],"en":"It's five to five."},{"t":[97.5,98.5],"en":"Just don't talk about the email, okay?"},{"t":[98.5,99.5],"en":"He's going to cancel it on his own."},{"t":[99.5,100.5],"en":"He's going to cancel it on his own."},{"t":[100.5,101.5],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[101.5,102.5],"en":"No, it's a jokey saying."},{"t":[102.5,103.5],"en":"It's a jokey saying."},{"t":[103.5,104.5],"en":"Po-buddy's nerfect."},{"t":[104.5,105.5],"en":"Like, I can't even say those words right."},{"t":[105.5,106.5],"en":"I haven't heard that before."},{"t":[106.5,107.5],"en":"That's funny."},{"t":[107.5,108.5],"en":"Dwight, there's just a small matter of..."},{"t":[108.5,110.5],"en":"You know what would go so great with this cabbage pie?"},{"t":[110.5,111.5],"en":"Milk."},{"t":[111.5,112.5],"en":"Any specific animal?"},{"t":[112.5,113.5],"en":"I'm thinking cow."},{"t":[113.5,114.5],"en":"What are you doing?"},{"t":[114.5,115.5],"en":"It's five to five."},{"t":[115.5,117],"en":"Just don't talk about the email, okay?"},{"t":[117,119],"en":"He's going to cancel it on his own."},{"t":[119,120],"en":"I really think he will."},{"t":[120,121],"en":"That's insane."},{"t":[121,122],"en":"Just trust me."},{"t":[122,124],"en":"Trust you like I trusted Dwight this morning?"},{"t":[124,125],"en":"I got this."},{"t":[125,135],"en":"Thanks for everything."},{"t":[135,137],"en":"Syve Dreyfley."},{"t":[137,148.5],"en":"Did you even drive safely?"},{"t":[148.5,149.5],"en":"Dwight stopped the device."},{"t":[149.5,150.5],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[150.5,151.5],"en":"Yes!"},{"t":[151.5,152.5],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[152.5,155.5],"en":"He stopped it."},{"t":[155.5,156.5],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[156.5,157.5],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[157.5,159.5],"en":"We still have our jobs!"},{"t":[159.5,161.5],"en":"They're not my favorite people in the world."},{"t":[161.5,163],"en":"I wouldn't even call them friends."},{"t":[163,166.5],"en":"They come over here, eat my pie, dig the crappiest horses."},{"t":[166.5,168],"en":"Grave you've ever seen."},{"t":[168,169],"en":"God."},{"t":[169,172],"en":"I'm going to have to work with them forever, aren't I?"}]}
